    "Mnemonic + seed derivation per BIP-39. Implemented in BIP39.swift / BIP39Seed.swift using only CryptoKit and Security framework.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "af": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mnemonic + seed-afleiding volgens BIP-39. Geïmplementeer in BIP39.swift / BIP39Seed.swift met slegs CryptoKit en die Security raamwerk."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "‏استخلاص العبارة التذكيرية والبذرة وفقًا لـ BIP-39. مُنفّذ في BIP39.swift / BIP39Seed.swift باستخدام إطار عمل CryptoKit وSecurity فقط."
          }
        },
        "bg": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Мнемоника + извличане на seed съгласно BIP-39. Реализирано в BIP39.swift / BIP39Seed.swift, използвайки само CryptoKit и Security framework."
          }
        },
        "bn": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "BIP-39 অনুযায়ী মেমোনিক এবং সিড ডেরিভেশন। শুধুমাত্র CryptoKit ও Security ফ্রেমওয়ার্ক ব্যবহার করে BIP39.swift / BIP39Seed.swift-এ বাস্তবায়িত।"
